                                "sense_id": "ffef6b65-e888-326f-a5a9-ab1b8d11c908",
                                "text": "‘But come on: haven’t you learnt even a little bit of Wolof yet?’"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3ed0d19c-541c-34d3-abab-e96770075e97",
